flowchart LR
  subgraph Authors[External authors own learners, data and original tasks]
    F[FastTD3 original program<br/>H1Hand Hurdle]
    M[Mulligan original programs<br/>Square-Narrow IDQL and DIVL]
    E[Real-Time EXPO original learner<br/>and asynchronous action sampler]
  end
  subgraph Harness[Root owns experiment orchestration]
    C[Pinned configurations and inputs]
    S[GPU0 supervision and finite run bounds]
    A[Declared Catcher task and backend adapter]
    R[Native logs, checkpoints, outcomes and recordings]
    V[Source and result review<br/>Root acceptance or explicit artifact recovery]
    U[Published reports and results viewer]
  end
  C -->|configuration| S
  S -->|control: original entrypoints| F
  S -->|control: original entrypoints| M
  S -->|control: original driver| E
  A <-->|observations, actions and rewards| E
  F -->|data| R
  M -->|data| R
  E -->|data| R
  R -->|evidence| V
  V -->|accepted measurements| U
  subgraph Future[Proposed R1 Lite transfer: no native training result]
    L[Leela owns physical scene and reset interface]
    D[Published data and annotation decisions]
    T[Sadhana owns task reward and action adapter<br/>then a matched learning experiment]
  end
  L -.->|validated scene and outcomes required| T
  D -.->|approved method-specific data views required| T
  U -.->|measured lessons and declared method choice| T
